// PermissioningPolicy Organization-level Besu account allowlist. accountsAllowlist is the shared list, applied to nodes with "Use shared list" turned on; each node's effective list = (uses shared list ? shared list : empty) ∪ the addresses added to that node directly (see custom). There is no enable switch: whether the allowlist is enabled is decided by the node's startup options, and the platform only detects it (see nodes for per-node results). nodes and custom are read-only and may be omitted from requests; if sent they are ignored, whatever their content.
